  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PLAN Sverige 2008-09</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PLAN Sweden 2008-09 - PLAN Sweden 08-09</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Tv&#xe5;-&#xe5;rigt ramavtal med Plan Sverige f&#xf6;r perioden 2008-2009, som syftar till att st&#xe4;rka civila samh&#xe4;llen inom barnr&#xe4;ttsfr&#xe5;gor. Programmet &#xe4;r &#xe4;ven indelat i flera olika delprogram var av ett innefattar information i Sverige med focus p&#xe5; milj&#xf6; och klimat inom barnr&#xe4;ttsomr&#xe5;det.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Two year Framework Agrement with Plan Sweden, for the period 2008-09, with the main focus of stregthening civil society with in the filed of children rights. Also including a Development Education component in Sweden on Environment and Climate with a child rights focus.</narrative>
  </description>
